{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>Do not rebel against him.</b> A term of rebellion, as in ״אֲשֶׁר יַמְרֶה אֶת פִּיךָ״ (Joshua 1)." "<b>For he will not bear with your transgression.</b> He is not practiced in this — for he is of the class that does not sin, and moreover he is an agent and does only his agency." "<b>For My name is within him.</b> Connected to the beginning of the verse — <b>Take heed of him, for My name</b> is associated in him. And our Rabbis said: this is Metatron, whose name is like the name of his Master — Metatron in gematria is Shaddai (Sanhedrin 38)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:54:10.953871244Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}